## PHẦN B — KIẾN TRÚC DỰ ÁN (Feature-First + Layered)

### B1. Cấu trúc thư mục

**`lib/app/` — Core Layer** (dùng chung toàn app):
- `config/` → AppTheme, AppPages, Flavor/Environment (dev/staging/prod via flutter_dotenv hoặc flutter_flavorizr)
- `constants/` → AppStrings, AppAssets (flutter_gen), AppColors, AppDimensions (static const)
- `utils/` → Helpers (DateUtils, StringUtils), Extensions (on BuildContext/String), Validators
- `widgets/` → AppButton, AppTextField, LoadingDialog, ErrorWidget, EmptyStateWidget, PaginatedListWidget
- `services/` → GetxService: ApiService (Dio + interceptors), StorageService (Hive/SharedPrefs), NotificationService (FCM), AnalyticsService, CrashReportingService
- `data/` → DTOs, Entities, Repository abstract interfaces + implementations
- `l10n/` → Internationalization (.arb files, flutter_intl)

**`lib/features/` — Feature Layer** (mỗi feature là module độc lập):
- `binding/` → Bindings cho DI
- `controller/` → GetxController (business logic, state)
- `pages/` hoặc `views/` → UI chính (GetView)
- `widgets/` → Widget riêng cho feature, đặt tên: `featureName_chucNangChinh_widget.dart`
- `data/` → models/repos riêng nếu không dùng chung
- `domain/` → Use cases nếu phức tạp (Clean Architecture)

**Ngoài lib:**
- `test/` → Mirror cấu trúc lib (unit/widget/integration)
- `integration_test/` → E2E tests
- `assets/` → images, icons, fonts (gen class bằng flutter_gen)

**Senior Tips:**
- Mỗi file < 300 dòng; nếu vượt → tách ra.
- Dùng barrel files để export, không over-export.
- Dự án lớn → tách thành separate packages (modularization).

